I modified `if_block()` in order to handle that differently, using a single block for all `if/else if`.

Take example of this dummy code : 
```svelte
{#if prop === 1}
	<div>one</div>
{:else if prop === 2}
	<div>two</div>
{:else if prop === 3}
	<div>three</div>
{:else if prop === 4}
	<div>four</div>
{:else if prop === 5}
	<div>five</div>
{:else}
	<div>...</div>
{/if}
